OL,3,GNEWSAExcavation work 'went against all
OL,4,Acodes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork done at an excavation site which
OL,7,Fcontributed to the deaths of ten people
OL,8,Fin a block of flats "went against all
OL,9,Fthe codes", a former employee has told
OL,10,Fthe Royal Court.
OL,12,FWorkers from Island Energy had been
OL,13,Fdisconnecting a redundant gas supply to
OL,14,FHaut du Mont on 9 December 2022 when
OL,15,Fthey accidentally cut off supplies to
OL,16,Fother commercial properties at La
OL,17,FCollette.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
