OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F443A1790006143
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+jp5w{j#57kjs15  jjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAExcavation work 'went against all
OL,4,Acodes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGas supplies were later reinstated at
OL,7,Fabout 19:15 GMT to some of the
OL,8,Fbuildings, including the St Helier
OL,9,FYacht Club, and to the block of flats
OL,10,Fat Haut du Mont, which exploded shortly
OL,11,Fbefore 04:00 the next morning.
OL,13,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, 58, John
OL,14,FWright, 60, and Lee Ward, 59, deny 10
OL,15,Fcounts of gross negligence
OL,16,Fmanslaughter.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
